dsh-skin-QWEN (千问花语 · QWEN Blossom)
====================================================

Artwork provenance notice

This skin ships two background paintings, both AI-generated images provided
by the user (shxvx) specifically for this skin:

1. Light theme — 《Dreamy Blue QWEN Blossom Portrait》
   淡蓝宣纸底、花枝与右侧汉服人物。
   Source file: assets/bg-light-source.png → assets/bg-light.webp
   (converted with sharp, quality 80, 1672×941)

2. Dark theme — 《Moonlit Pavilion Dreamscape》
   月夜亭台、靛蓝金灯。
   Source file: assets/bg-dark-source.png → assets/bg-dark.webp
   (converted with sharp, quality 80, 1672×941)

Both WebP files are embedded as base64 data URIs in src/client/art.ts
(generated by scripts/embed-skin-art.mjs) and therefore also inside
lib/client.js. Preview crops live in preview/. The decorative 回纹角花 /
回纹分隔带 motifs are original inline SVG paths authored for this skin
(not derived from the paintings).

